# ACE OS package selection.
# Kept lean on purpose: the target machine has 4 GB RAM and 128 GB eMMC.

## Desktop (XFCE — light enough for 4 GB RAM)
task-xfce-desktop
task-laptop
lightdm
xfce4-power-manager
xfce4-screenshooter
mousepad
ristretto
xarchiver
thunar-archive-plugin

## Installer (graphical, beginner-friendly)
calamares
calamares-settings-debian

## Everyday apps
firefox-esr
vlc
gnome-disk-utility
gparted

## Hardware support for the ASUS L510M (Gemini Lake platform)
firmware-linux
firmware-iwlwifi
firmware-realtek
firmware-atheros
firmware-sof-signed
intel-microcode
intel-media-va-driver

## Performance on low RAM / eMMC
zram-tools
